<section id="Sx6" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section">Reproducibility Checklist</h2>
<span class="ltx_rule" style="width:100%;height:1px;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>
<section id="Sx6.SSx7.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">1. General Paper Structure</h4>

<div id="Sx6.SSx7.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<ul id="Sx6.I3" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="Sx6.I3.ix1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">1.1.</span> 
<div id="Sx6.I3.ix1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Sx6.I3.ix1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Includes a conceptual outline and/or pseudocode description of AI methods introduced (yes/partial/no/NA) <span id="Sx6.I3.ix1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;">
yes</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="Sx6.I3.ix2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">1.2.</span> 
<div id="Sx6.I3.ix2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Sx6.I3.ix2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Clearly delineates statements that are opinions, hypothesis, and speculation from objective facts and results (yes/no) <span id="Sx6.I3.ix2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;">
